Package: com.seagull.splitpane
Name: SplitPane
Version: 0.5.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: PV-style vertical split pane for iOS 16. Swipe up from the bottom home-bar strip to park the foreground app, pick a second app, and get a live top/bottom split with a draggable seam. True arm64e, springboard injected.
Maintainer: Seagull
Author: Seagull
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.1), mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: com.82flex.panoramicview
